ories":"Coffee & Tea, Food","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"E5YB7NywtfmQ2_rpxtjmKQ","review_id":"6xQnR1nk50OnslPgx8X9bA","date":"2015-04-19T01:28:59","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9378990530967712,"text_excerpt":"You will get a solid breakfast here, no doubt. I've been a few times now and each visit has been a good experience. The place is always busy, definitely a good sign. Plus my being a breakfast enthusiast, pancakes and waffles always holds a special place in my existence. Nothing modern about the design, it's very original on the inside. It certainly feels like a place fitting of its name if you follow me. Nothing bad about that, I'm just saying the place feels right. It was pretty much just what I expected the first time I went. I usually order the chicken fried steak tho as I think it's one of the best dishes on Earth and Betsy's is hella good. The wait staff has been pleasant on my visit..."},{"business_id":"E5YB7NywtfmQ2_rpxtjmKQ","review_id":"3DtzkRTd6cFNv3QlgJX53A","date":"2017-03-28T17:51:46","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9347463846206665,"text_excerpt":"Betsy's is just a great breakfast spot. Not fancy, but you'll run into the best people here. The staff is consistent, friendly and as fast as they can be with the constant stream of patrons rolling in. Prices are AWESOME! Food is EXCELLENT! Solid breakfast everytime. And the $5 weekday special can't be beat! Coffee is good too and they keep it coming. I'll eat here any day (except Saturday, they're closed)."},{"business_id":"E5YB7NywtfmQ2_rpxtjmKQ","review_id":"fpt7AnAQ8938TsrHL9946g","date":"2011-03-18T22:33:59","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9287528991699219,"text_excerpt":"Had breakfast at Betsy's again this morning - this is turning into a regular spot for me and Mr. D. It's kind of amazing to get 2 eggs, bacon, toast or pancakes and hash browns for 5.50 (there's a .75 cent upcharge for replacing grits with hash browns) - we really like the hash browns, although I concur that they are really more like a potato hash than hash browns, so to speak. I had my usual strawberry belgian waffle for 5.50 with whip cream. the coffee hits the table right away, the service is friendly and the food is good, fast and cheap. What more do you want at breakfast? I wouldn't go for the ambiance or anything, but for solid cheap breakfast eats it's hard to top Betsy's!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"E5YB7NywtfmQ2_rpxtjmKQ","photo_id":"Esb4ktUGEYl_o6Y-DFEeyA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/Esb4ktUGEYl_o6Y-DFEeyA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8936115503311157},{"business_id":"E5YB7NywtfmQ2_rpxtjmKQ","photo_id":"YyjzMLlsEvCVshdu6PcMKg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/YyjzMLlsEvCVshdu6PcMKg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8912392854690552},{"business_id":"E5YB7NywtfmQ2_rpxtjmKQ","photo_id":"HFawhT6wLbGuRl8ycYKnjg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/HFawhT6wLbGuRl8ycYKnjg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8197197914123535},{"business_id":"E5YB7NywtfmQ2_rpxtjmKQ","photo_id":"TxSEmn0GkWCZjAyQdKxwEw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/TxSEmn0GkWCZjAyQdKxwEw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.6665266752243042}]},"notebook_case":null}
